    "name_suffix": "_2026",
    "long_instructions": "### **User Journey: Reset/Undo**\r\n\r\n**Scenario:** You are designing a product filter page for an online store. Users can filter by categories, price ranges, and ratings. Your page needs two separate features:\r\n\r\n1. **Reset All:** Goes back to the original product list (no filters).\r\n2. **Undo:** Removes just the *last* change the user made.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nComplete the diagram by:\r\n1. **Completing 4a (Reset Path):** Show what the page looks like after the user clicks Reset All.\r\n2. **Completing 4b (Undo Path):** Show what the page looks like after the user clicks Undo.\r\n3. **Adding an emotional label to every state:** Think about how might the user feel at each step (e.g., \"confident,\" \"frustrated,\" \"relieved\")"
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-07T14:19:05.013+00:00\",\"changed\":[\"cloned from \\\"building-data-driven-systems-lesson11-template-sketchlab_v2_2026\\\"\"],\"cloned_from\":\"building-data-driven-systems-lesson11-template-sketchlab_v2_2026\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-07 14:19:32 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":155,\"changed_by_email\":\"dani@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-06-12 00:07:19 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":18602,\"changed_by_email\":\"angelina+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-06-12 00:11:50 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":18602,\"changed_by_email\":\"angelina+levelbuilder@code.org\"}]"
